    <detaileddescription>
<para>This option affects the ABI for the nodes. When not specified explicitly, the ABI depends on LLVM_ENABLE_ABI_BREAKING_CHECKS. Specify explicitly to enable <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1ilist__node__impl_1a0570092282570244c4d7af86003f0aa9" kindref="member">ilist_node::isSentinel()</ref></emphasis>. </para>
